02:28:27.200 --> 02:29:18.500
<v SPEAKER_3>Well even I myself at that point didn't think anything had really happened. It's just I would wake up. As I recall, I say I may have seen some kind of sci-fi movie or something that had an abduction. I don't know how many would have already been out by that time. We're talking about the early 60s. But as I recall, I didn't even make any kind of connection to alien abduction for a while. It just happened. I kept thinking why is the dream kept happening? Why is this dream happening? So consciously for me at least, I don't think I made any connection to it until maybe a, well, after Betty and Barney Hill story came out, and then other stories started coming out. And I would read those and began to think, wow, that sounds a lot like my dream. But I was never convinced that it actually, anything actually happened to me. Just kind of piqued my interest and somehow got into my mind.

